  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Grate the carrot. Thinly slice capsicum.\n• Cut firm tofu (see ingredients) into 1cm pieces.\n• In a medium bowl, combine cornflour (see ingredients) and Southeast Asian spice blend. Add tofu and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6226f9714999067190267329/step-a61505d3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook capsicum, tossing, until tender, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a plate.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil. When oil is hot, shake excess flour off the tofu, then cook tofu, turning occasionally, until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• Remove pan from heat. Add plant-based Asian mushroom sauce and cooked capsicum to pan, tossing to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6226f9714999067190267329/step-e9022ab1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While tofu is cooking, combine grated carrot, deluxe slaw mix, mayonnaise and a drizzle of rice wine vinegar in a large bowl. Season to taste.\n• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a plate in 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6226f9714999067190267329/step-d0b78996.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Fill each tortilla with a helping of slaw and Asian-style tofu and capsicum.\n• Sprinkle with crushed peanuts to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6226f9714999067190267329/step-5891fa7c.jpg"
    }
  ]
